{"2007880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lawnmower Maniac", "steam_appid": 2007880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He’s cutting more than grass...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007880/extras/e4a1080413d57c7c6484680ba2725d8e.poster.avif?t=1781727524\" width=630 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007880/extras/e4a1080413d57c7c6484680ba2725d8e.webm?t=1781727524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007880/extras/e4a1080413d57c7c6484680ba2725d8e.mp4?t=1781727524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lawnmower Maniac</strong> is a short, sandbox-style exploration horror experience designed to be completed in one sitting. Explore a colorful yet surreal, melting world brought to life with 90s-inspired low-poly visuals, optional retro filters, and a nostalgic 4:3 aspect ratio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007880/extras/21dbb0c6b97ef74ef128b24d3d8b6ba7.poster.avif?t=1781727524\" width=600 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007880/extras/21dbb0c6b97ef74ef128b24d3d8b6ba7.webm?t=1781727524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007880/extras/21dbb0c6b97ef74ef128b24d3d8b6ba7.mp4?t=1781727524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s 3:00 AM. A lawnmower roars outside your window. Who cuts grass at this hour? Step into the moonlight in your pajamas, explore Samer Hills, meet the locals, and try to survive the night! There's a maniac out there and he's not just mowing down the yard...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007880/extras/aae350eb30e1725f311aafd7f67a2d05.poster.avif?t=1781727524\" width=600 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007880/extras/aae350eb30e1725f311aafd7f67a2d05.webm?t=1781727524\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007880/extras/aae350eb30e1725f311aafd7f67a2d05.mp4?t=1781727524\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Controller support / Universal Controller support - Works with most gamepads including third-party ones such as 8BitDo controllers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PSX-inspired, wobbly, mind-boggling graphics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 4:3 aspect ratio with a low resolution of 960x720.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional VHS and CRT retro filters that can be toggled on or off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90s nostalgia, a full moon, and the smell of freshly cut grass...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007880/extras/e780df453720e07c4e660a56a56c82e5.poster.avif?t=1781727524\" width=500 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i